Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The beastmen from Howling Village moved here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you need anything, just ask Lamulias.\NShe's the housing manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.29,0:00:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, you don't need to be that formal...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they all thought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that they were going to be treated\Nhorribly when they moved here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Naturally, we have no such intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There doesn't seem to be any apparent\Nproblem with the new residents, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:31.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They faint quite often.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, they'll just have to get\Nused to things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:57.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Masshiro hikari no naka me o samashite\Nhajimatteiku sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:03.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Fumidasu atarashii sekai donna hana o sakaseyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:11.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Kumori sora datte mizutamari de yogoretatte
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:14.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura wa susumu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:21.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Souzou mo shinai mirai ga matteiru kitto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:24.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Deatte deatte tsunagatteku
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:28.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Waraeba mawari mo egao ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:32.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Chiisana tane maite sodateyou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:36.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Yagate ookina hana ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:39.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Koukai ya shippai wa kate ni shite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:43.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Karafuru na shiawase de afureru youni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:47.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura te o toriatte wakeatte
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:53.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu ni hirogatteike Flower Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.25,0:02:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you need to be\Nmore careful when you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can use magic too, Sena?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... am I the only one here\Nwho can't use magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, all of the angels can use magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All of the high elves can use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's common for us to be able to use\Nfire and water magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're good with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even the bees can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:02:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one\Nwho can't use magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's practice together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling these kids\Nwill surpass me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well. There's no point\Nin wishing for the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll just focus on what I can do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was that? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.75,0:03:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A grappler bear and a bloody viper are\Nfighting in the northern area of the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bear and viper?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:27.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A bear and a snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Them fighting with each other is enough\Nto make the ground shake this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm... a bear and a snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, it might affect the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it would be dangerous to get\Ninvolved without a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So about those animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,do you think we can eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So anyways, I've heard that hunters\Nsometimes eat bear meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've always wondered how they taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, they're big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go back for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No. Just take me down really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I got a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One... Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you take down a monster\Nlike that with one attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah... the mayor is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looking at him up close, he really is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As far as cooking them goes,\Nwhat do you plan to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got some ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll add in some of these herbs and spices.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now we add wine and simmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our precious wine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine. That kind of cooking is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:05:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And there we have it,\Nwine braised grappler bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's incredibly gamey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our precious wine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you this is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And this is the blood viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried frying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This tastes just like fried chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It tastes different than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It tastes surprisingly like chicken breast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which means my plate is missing\Nsomething that goes right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So then, what brings you here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you had anything\Nthat could act as an anti-bacterial agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anti-bacterial?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:43.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I need it for a new recipe\NI want to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have any medicines that can\Nkill harmful microorganisms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Microorganisms!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are the things you spoke of before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want something that will prevent\Nstomach aches or illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, how about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One dose is enough to blast anything\Nto the other side of the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have anything that's more peaceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then how about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This one is safe to use in foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, how's the\Nmiso production coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is, it's not going very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did everything exactly like you told me to,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but no matter how long I waited it never\Nseemed like it was starting to ferment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've had to rebuild my hut three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, let's give it another try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll try to keep the explosives to a minimum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please don't use any.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There we go. That looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, we beat the eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we add salt and vinegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, this vinegar\Nis made from apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's also fermented, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we mix it as we slowly add in the oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now we have mayonnaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:13.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now it's exactly like having fried chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow! I can eat this stuff by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop that right now.\NIt's terrible for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, on to making miso.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, we start by simmering\Nthe soybeans we soaked in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we grind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:34.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Moldy, moldy, moldy, mold!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Moldy, moldy, moldy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:36.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I used the almighty farming tool\Nto help make the koji mold.\N{\rSubtitle}Moldy, moldy, moldy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:37.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I used the almighty farming tool\Nto help make the koji mold.\N{\rSubtitle}You don't need to write that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't need to write that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We mixed the koji with salt\Nand formed balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now we pack it into barrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:46.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mine didn't work because\NI didn't say moldy, moldy, mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that's... well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now we just let it age in the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll take a few months,\Nso let's wait patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But all that time will make\Nthe flavors even more intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This requires perseverance,\Njust like research.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've got visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The visitors were a group of dwarves\Nled by a man named Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're elder dwarves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:21.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've heard that you have\Nhigh quality alcohol in this village,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we'd like you to share some with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean our wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to share with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor. We can't give it away for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right. Our wine is very valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but they're our guests...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we don't have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, we do have technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Technology?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've spent our lives\Nstudying alcohol production,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:50.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we've traveled a long way to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have some very fine\Ncrops in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can help you turn them\Ninto fine alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think?\NDon't you want to drink some?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Donovan and his men got to work\Non the alcohol right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Distillation... I remember doing this\Nin science class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here you go. This is corn whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll get its color when we\Nage it in barrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:29.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess the mayor is a lightweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Donovan and his men ended up staying\Nin the village and working as our brewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that we've got new alcohol,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's time to have a welcome party for\Nthe beastmen and the dwarves!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Drink up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can really taste the fragrance\Nwhen you drink this alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really like this mayonnaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This goes perfect with the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:09:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's drink all night!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:09:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He snuck in again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't mind that he comes here,\Nbut he always drinks too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright! It's time to show you all\Nmy special technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was kind of you to take us all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.\NWe're all happy you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are a lot of people\Nin this village who like to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, I finally got some\Nadult men to join the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking for any particular reason, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are there any girls here who catch your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, the kind that make you\Nthink "Wow, she's pretty!"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well they're all very good looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you know, I think they're all\Na little too young for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they can't at least grow a beard,\Nthen they're not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-a beard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, why are you making me\Nsay it out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The cultural barrier is high.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:10:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in Anoooother...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,World.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me there's another wyvern.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, a dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's headed straight for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't look friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish this one off before it\Ncauses any damage to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't that... Dryme?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this infighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But they're just staring each other down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's another one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That one's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I missed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the next one won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:54.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That isn't an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry for the confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These two are my master's wife\Nand his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lastismoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Graffaloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-nice to meet you. I'm Hiraku Machio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are your wife and daughter here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Dryme's constant sneaking out\Nso that he could come to our village
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,has roused some suspicions at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What were we supposed to think\Nwhen he was sneaking out every night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it turned out that he really was\Nsneaking out to do something he shouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a ridiculous accusation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you were sneaking off with\Nall kinds of stuff from the treasury!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you'd always be out\Ntill the next morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the gifts he always brings us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:49.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I was worried about him\Ngoing home drunk, so I built him a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:51.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe that wasn't such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was all for the sake of\Nour diplomatic relations!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was all very high-level politics,\Nyou see, and uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He's hiding something.\N{\rSubtitle}It was all very high-level politics,{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}you see, and uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,my suspicions...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are all being confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think this man...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even has the courage...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to have an affair like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you all happy with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though I didn't know who you were,\NI'm sorry about how I acted earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, don't worry about it.\NThis was all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on you two, apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I was about to\Nburn the village down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because I thought my dad\Nwas having an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry that I was about to\Nobliterate the insolent man
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who pointed a spear at my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess everything's settled now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But dear, you still shouldn't be\Nsneaking out to get drunk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.63,0:13:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NYou get out of hand when you drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm just glad to see that\Nthey're getting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what I was doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our relationship with this village\Nis of the utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Despite their lack of numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they still have the power necessary\Nto challenge us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never thought we'd meet anyone\Nthat had the strength to overwhelm us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even defend against that attack.\NYou had to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even that was only thanks to the spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. An old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Had I not been pulled out of the way;\NI may not be standing here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a very important job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to live here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.29,0:14:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please keep your mouth shut, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't ignore that kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't expect you to be able to suppress it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just expect you to do your duty
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and make sure that such power\Nis never turned against us dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I believe that choosing this path\Nwill lead to the best outcome for Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I look forward to working together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind,\Nplease call me Lasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what should I do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:22.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Let's see...\N{\rSubtitle}And so, Lasty immediately{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}went to work in the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:24.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,How about you start helping\Nwith the harvesting?\N{\rSubtitle}And so, Lasty immediately{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}went to work in the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to start now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-are you a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...dragons are pretty extraordinary\Nin all regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gently...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gently...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like it'll take a while\Nfor her to get used to her work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should we do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't need to make her do\Nsomething she isn't a fit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But Dryme told me to give her work\Nto do around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've been like this ever since\Nall the dragons showed up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The cows and chickens\Nhave all be scared, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We haven't been able to get\Nany milk or eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dryme acts like that,\Nso I wasn't really thinking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but everyone is normally\Nafraid of dragons, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not just power they have, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Their knowledge and wisdom are also great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about i...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lastismoon, and I'm currently\Nin charge of handling
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,diplomatic relations here at the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,D-don't tell you me you're that dragon girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am! Please call me Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it that you've come to\Nrequest from us today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,F-first off, we'd like some more of those\Nbright colored fruit we got last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:16:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean the oranges, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say that our stock of them\Nis running quite low at the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could I interest you in\Nsome strawberries instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're perfectly ripe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-in that case, I'll take ten boxes of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could I interest you in some apples\Nand pears to go with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have persimmons and\Nwatermelons as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay, I'll take those as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:24.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like to count them\Nto confirm the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:27.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well then.\NWe look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like she's got the hang of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They have dragons now? Is this a joke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That village's military might\Ngrows by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to monitor them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should we send a spy there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they find out, they'll consider it\Nan act of aggression!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have no other choice.\NI have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You called for me, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flowrem, have a seat there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:02.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.50,0:18:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, I'm to investigate that village, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. In particular, their military might.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, you mustn't do anything rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your safety must always be\Nyour number one concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I am your daughter, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm confident in my magical abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At a glance, this seems like\Njust an ordinary village, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how did they develop a village like this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in the middle of a forest filled with\Nsuch terrifying monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome to The Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lastismoon,\Nthe head of diplomatic relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to stay here\Nin this village for a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard from Beezel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Call me Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't Lastismoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that infamous dragon\Nthat everyone is afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I've already met\Nsomeone this powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And this here is our vineyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can make delicious wine\Nfrom these grapes here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My father said that the wine here\Nis the most delicious in all the lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:17.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This seems like just an ordinary vineyard.\N{\rSubtitle}My father said that the wine here{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}is the most delicious in all the lands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:17.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This seems like just an ordinary vineyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is a legendary dragon in a place like\Nthis bragging to me about crops they're growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:21.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Roar! Roar!\N{\rSubtitle}Why is a legendary dragon in a place like{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}this bragging to me about crops they're growing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is a legendary dragon in a place like\Nthis bragging to me about crops they're growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:23.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Roar!\N{\rSubtitle}Why is a legendary dragon in a place like{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}this bragging to me about crops they're growing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is a legendary dragon in a place like\Nthis bragging to me about crops they're growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And get this, so then my dad told me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've spotted a messenger\Nfrom Howling Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I need to go take care of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll just have a look around on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This works out perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can take the opportunity to analyze\Ntheir military strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are lizardmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Beastmen and ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And even dwarves?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll all be tough to deal with,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but with the full force of our military\Nwe might be able to handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This might be their headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The vampire princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:07.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It won't have enough firepower like this.\N{\rSubtitle}The vampire princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:08.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It won't have enough firepower like this.\N{\rSubtitle}I heard she was on the run from nobles,{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}so she was laying low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard she was on the run from nobles,\Nso she was laying low.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:10.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let's add twice as much.\N{\rSubtitle}I heard she was on the run from nobles,{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}so she was laying low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let's add twice as much.\N{\rSubtitle}What's she doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:13.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Our aerial defenses in this area\Nhave been getting neglected lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:15.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Our aerial defenses in this area\Nhave been getting neglected lately.\N{\rSubtitle}The angel of annihilation, Tia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Our aerial defenses in this area\Nhave been getting neglected lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is she in the same village as Lulucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:19.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure we're trying our hardest here.\N{\rSubtitle}Why is she in the same village as Lulucy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The safety of the village rests in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:22.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The safety of the village rests in our hands.\N{\rSubtitle}And I'm pretty sure I heard that those three{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}are called the trio of killer angels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:23.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Yes.\N{\rSubtitle}And I'm pretty sure I heard that those three{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}are called the trio of killer angels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'm pretty sure I heard that those three\Nare called the trio of killer angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They even have high elves here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:28.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You look sleepy.\N{\rSubtitle}They even have high elves here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:29.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You look sleepy.\N{\rSubtitle}I've heard that those are{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}the terrifying maneaters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:30.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Good morning.\N{\rSubtitle}I've heard that those are{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}the terrifying maneaters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:30.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Good morning.\N{\rSubtitle}that prey upon helpless young men{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and kidnap them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that prey upon helpless young men\Nand kidnap them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:32.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Good morning.\N{\rSubtitle}that prey upon helpless young men{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and kidnap them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that prey upon helpless young men\Nand kidnap them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If there are five of them here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then this is already too much\Nfor our military to handle...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They have inferno wolves\Nand demon spiders!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And they've formed one single pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up until now, I've been proud to call myself
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,one of the most talented magic users\Nin all of the demon kingdom, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like all my confidence has left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To command all of these powerful troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it would make sense to assume that Lastismoon\Nwas in charge of such an organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But there's someone above her\Ncalled the mayor who rules over all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of terrifying opponent\Nam I dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.67,0:21:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is a human here of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you lost or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not so weak that I need an ordinary human\Nto be worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? That person I saw just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup. That's the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But isn't he just an ordinary human?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a human strong enough\Nto defeat my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forget saying hello,\NI was outright rude to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found out that girl was Beezel's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:22:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she's going to\Nlive here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:01.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:02.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hand.\N{\rSubtitle}She seems to be getting along well with Lasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She seems to be getting along well with Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's great and all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.71,0:22:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning, mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G-good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a lovely day!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...for some reason,\Nshe acted like this for a while.
